      <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
      <li><a href="#certificates">Certificates</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>
</header>

<!-- HOME -->
<div class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1>Dawit Girma Buayu</h1>
    <h2>Lecturer and Researcher | Water Resources Engineering</h2>
    <p>
      Department of Civil Engineering, Wolkite University, Ethiopia.
      I am a lecturer, researcher, and engineering professional specializing
      in hydraulic engineering, hydrology, water resources management,
      GIS, remote sensing, and engineering design.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-buttons">
      <a class="btn" href="#publications">View Publications</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#contact">Contact Me</a>
      <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="window.print()">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf"></i> Print / Save CV as PDF
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<main>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about">
  <h2 class="section-title">About Me</h2>
  <p>
    I am a Lecturer and Researcher at Wolkite University, Ethiopia,
    with an academic background in Hydraulic and Water Resources Engineering
    and Civil Engineering (Hydraulic Engineering). I hold a B.Sc. degree
    in Hydraulic and Water Resources Engineering from Wollega University
    and an M.Sc. degree in Civil Engineering (Hydraulic Engineering)
    from Addis Ababa University.
  </p>
  <br>
  <p>
    My academic and professional interests include hydrological modeling,
    water resources planning and management, climate change impacts,
    groundwater assessment, flood risk management, irrigation engineering,
    and geospatial applications. I also have practical engineering
    experience in water supply and irrigation construction projects,
    engineering design, site supervision, and construction management.
  </p>
</section>

<!-- EDUCATION -->
<section id="education">
  <h2 class="section-title">Education</h2>

  <div class="item">
