<!-- PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE -->
<section id="professional-experience">
  <h2 class="section-title">Professional Engineering Experience</h2>

  <div class="item">
    <h3>Site and Office Engineer – GMN Water Works Construction Plc.</h3>
    <p class="date">March 01, 2022 – September 13, 2025 | Part-time</p>
    <p>
      Worked on water works construction projects involving engineering
      documentation, design review, site supervision, technical coordination,
      and construction management.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="item">
    <h3>Site and Office Engineer – Etenesh Abebaw WWC</h3>
    <p class="date">January 02, 2017 – February 05, 2022 | Part-time</p>
    <p>
      Participated in various water supply and irrigation projects,
      supporting engineering design, office engineering, and site activities.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h3 class="skill-category">Key Engineering Responsibilities</h3>
  <ul class="detail-list">
    <li>Engineering documentation and design review</li>
    <li>AutoCAD drawings and engineering layouts</li>
    <li>Engineering design calculations</li>
    <li>Preparation of Bills of Quantities (BOQ)</li>
    <li>Cost estimation and material take-offs</li>
    <li>Site supervision and quality control</li>
    <li>Construction management and technical problem-solving</li>
    <li>Quantity measurements and progress monitoring</li>
    <li>Coordination with contractors, subcontractors, and suppliers</li>
    <li>Ensuring compliance with engineering drawings and safety standards</li>
  </ul>
</section>

